    "body": "LGTM. @romandev @jungkees, are either of you willing to handle the Blink change? This also need tests, but I think the tests for it would need to be in https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/tree/master/service-workers:\n- `new MessageEvent({source: serviceWorker})` in both a window and worker context.\n- that `message` events originating from `postMessage` are `instanceof MessageEvent`.\n- maybe an historical.html that checks that ServiceWorkerMessageEvent is gone.\n\nVolunteers?\n",
