    "created_at": "2016-10-25T13:45:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-25T13:45:12Z",
    "body": "Just to clarify, this won't remove the message event `waitUntil()` method in a service worker will it?  I assume thats not being put on the generic `MessageEvent`, so how can we completely replace `ServiceWorkerMessageEvent` at this time?\n",
