    "created_at": "2016-10-25T14:03:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-25T14:03:56Z",
    "body": "`waitUntil()` is defined in `ExtendableEvent`. `ExtendableMessageEvent` inherits `ExtendableEvent`, but `ServiceWorkerMessageEvent` does not. `ServiceWorkerMessageEvent` has the same interface with `MessageEvent` except its `source` attribute.\n\nWe'll not remove `waitUntil()` from `ExtendableMessageEvent`. In my understanding, the further plan is when the Mixins is spec'ed in Web IDL, we'll define a shared Mixin that `ExtendableMessageEvent`, which has only `waitUntil()` inherited from `ExtendableEvent`, will implement.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
